            "evidence_roles": [
              "BACKUP"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "custom layers",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_d2212eb9f9ae14979349b33d",
            "source_text": "In this chapter, we will peel back the curtain,\ndigging deeper into the key components of deep learning computation,\nnamely model construction, parameter access and initialization,\ndesigning custom layers and blocks, reading and writing models to disk,\nand leveraging GPUs to achieve dramatic speedups.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_convolutional_modern_batch_norm_b037",
            "boundary_only": false,
            "chapter_id": "d2l_convolutional_modern",
            "content_sha256": "183ac81c42007397ac06d3e45c8acf60197fabfdde8696ec197d903851e3085c",
            "context_id": "ctx_73804fdbddef8388a5550f4a",
            "evidence_roles": [
              "BACKUP"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "custom layer",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_88458388a6d1feaf20f9b956",
            "source_text": "We then integrate this functionality into a custom layer,\nwhose code mostly addresses bookkeeping matters,\nsuch as moving data to the right device context,\nallocating and initializing any required variables,\nkeeping track of moving averages (here for mean and variance), and so on.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_deep_learning_computation_custom_layer_b004",
            "boundary_only": false,
            "chapter_id": "d2l_deep_learning_computation",
            "content_sha256": "1d285a1681394b126a53045c4a461cb44004718edf73ec2e2c97a8bc01900e5e",
            "context_id": "ctx_c650fc71af7d6c2789e47035",
            "evidence_roles": [
              "POSITIVE_DEFINITION_PROPOSAL",
              "PRIMARY"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "custom layer",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_42caa2359c8c1411b3abf461",
            "source_text": "To start, we construct a custom layer\nthat does not have any parameters of its own.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_deep_learning_computation_custom_layer_b002",
            "boundary_only": false,
