            "sentence_id": "sentence_66e5c5fb8607b702d5e007b8",
            "source_text": "In :numref:`sec_prob` we saw the basics of how to work with discrete random variables, which in our case refer to those random variables which take either a finite set of possible values, or the integers.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
